    "probe_text": "Confirmed against source. Here is the complete, ordered account of what happens on `POST /api/owners` (handled by `OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner`, since v2 only implements the GET).\n\n## Validations & side-effects, in execution order\n\n**Framework gate (before the method body runs):**\n\n1. **Authorization** \u2014 `@PreAuthorize(\"hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)\")`. Caller must have the `OWNER_ADMIN` role, else 403.\n2. **Bean Validation on the request body** \u2014 `@Valid @RequestBody OwnerFieldsDto` (interface is `@Validated`). Enforced on `OwnerFieldsDto`:\n   - `firstName`: `@NotNull`, `@Size(1,30)`, `@Pattern` (letters, up to 3 words, ` '-` separators)\n   - `lastName`: `@NotNull`, `@Size(1,30)`, `@Pattern` (same, trailing `.` allowed)\n   - `address`: `@NotNull`, `@Size(1,255)`\n   - `city`: `@NotNull`, `@Size(1,80)`\n   - `telephone`: `@NotNull`, `@Size(1,20)` (note: no pattern here \u2014 strict format is applied later)\n   - `email`: `@Size(1,255)`, `@Email` (nullable)\n   - `postcode`: `@Pattern(\"^[0-9]{4}$\")` (nullable)\n   - `registrationDate`, `birthDate`: `@Valid` (nullable dates)\n   - Failure \u2192 400.\n\n**Controller body \u2014 imperative checks, in this exact order:**\n\n3. **Telephone normalization** (`normalizeTelephone`) \u2014 normalizes to E.164, applies a national-length rule. Returns `null` \u2192 **400**. (`:118`)\n4. **Address normalization** (`Owner.normalizeAddress`) \u2014 if `null` or blank \u2192 **400**. (`:122`)\n5. **Disposable-email domain check** (`isDisposableEmailDomain`) \u2014 rejects mailinator.com / tempmail.com / guerrillamail.com \u2192 **400**. (`:126`)\n6. **Map DTO \u2192 `Owner`** (`ownerMapper.toOwner`) \u2014 *side-effect:* the entity setters normalize address (uppercase + abbreviation expansion) and lowercase the email. Then the normalized telephone is set onto the owner. (`:129-130`)\n7. **Postcode-valid-for-city** (`owner.isPostcodeValidForCity`) \u2014 if invalid \u2192 **400**. (`:131`)\n8. **Compute & assign `householdId`** from (lastName, postcode) \u2014 *side-effect,* set up front so later checks key off it. (`:138`)\n9. Read `sharesHousehold` flag from the DTO. (`:139`)\n10. **Hard-duplicate check** \u2014 scans all owners (`findAllOwners`); if any existing owner's full `identityKey` (telephone|email|householdId) matches \u2192 **409**. (`:144-147`)\n11. **Household-duplicate check** (`findHouseholdMembers`) \u2014 if any existing owner shares the computed `householdId` and `sharesHousehold` is not true \u2192 **409**. (`:154-156`)\n12. **Per-city cap** (`countOwnersInCity`) \u2014 if \u2265 50 owners in that city \u2192 **409**. (`:158`)\n13. **Future-date check** \u2014 if `registrationDate` is after today \u2192 **400**. (`:161`)\n14. **Compute effective/business-day registration date** (`toBusinessDay`) \u2014 rolls the effective date (given or today) to a business day. (`:164-166`)\n15. **Per-day cap** (`countOwnersRegisteredOn`) \u2014 if \u2265 100 owners registered on that business day \u2192 **429 (TOO_MANY_REQUESTS)**. (`:167-169`)\n16. **Bulk-signup warning flag** \u2014 set true if > 80 registered that day. (`:171`)\n\n**Derived-field population (side-effects on the entity, all before save):** (`:173-186`)\n\n17. `registrationDate` \u2190 computed business day\n18. `customerCode` \u2190 `customerCode(owner)`\n19. `namesakeCount` \u2190 `countNamesakes(firstName, lastName)`\n20. `bulkSignupWarning` \u2190 flag from step 16\n21. `householdSize` \u2190 existing members + 1\n22. **Soft-match \"possible duplicate\"** (`findPossibleDuplicate`, skipped when `sharesHousehold`) \u2192 sets `possibleDuplicate` (bool) and `possibleDuplicateOf` (id).\n\n**Persistence & response:**\n\n23. **`clinicService.saveOwner(owner)`** \u2014 the only DB write (`@Transactional`; JPA `persist` for new id). *This is the primary side-effect.* (`:187`)\n24. **Audit log** \u2014 `AUDIT.info(\"owner created id=\u2026 customerCode=\u2026 registrationDate=\u2026 membershipLevel=\u2026\")`. (`:188`)\n25. **Map `Owner` \u2192 `OwnerDto`** (`toOwnerDto`, adds `displayName` + `initials`), set `Location: /api/owners/{id}` header, return **201 CREATED**. (`:190-193`)\n\n## Notes worth flagging\n- **No custom `ConstraintValidator`s, no `@PrePersist`/`@EntityListeners`, and no application events** exist \u2014 the \"audit\" is just an SLF4J log line, and all business rules live imperatively in the controller.\n- **Telephone is validated twice with different rules**: the DTO only enforces `@Size(1,20)`, while the real E.164 format is enforced by `normalizeTelephone` (step 3) and, on flush, by the `Owner.telephone` `@Pattern(\"^\\\\+[0-9]{8,15}$\")`.\n- The duplicate/cap checks (steps 10, 11, 12, 15) each independently call `findAllOwners()` \u2014 repeated full-table scans on every create."
